# VS Code REST Client. Phase 0: the monolith listens on 8000.
@base = http://localhost:8000

### Liveness: process is up
GET {{base}}/health/live

### Readiness: Postgres reachable (503 if not)
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Correlation ID is echoed back
GET {{base}}/health/live
X-Correlation-ID: 3f2b8c1e-0d4a-4e6b-9c7d-1a2b3c4d5e6f
